      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town was named after Seminole chief Osceola, with the name suggested by Vinson Perry Davis after the Iowa town that honored the same chief.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        4,
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
