      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Omaha & Republican Valley Railroad arrived in June 1879, bringing a locomotive named after the city before it was renumbered to “9.”.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
